INSERT INTO `quest_offer_reward` (`ID`, `Emote1`, `Emote2`, `Emote3`, `Emote4`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `EmoteDelay4`, `RewardText`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
(40395, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'A book of mine? Hah, I am no reader...$B$BCould it be?', 0),
(40470, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'What a fine specimen! A little cracked, but this should work just fine. My client is trying to get to the bottom of what caused these golems to go haywire, and he needs all the samples he can get.$B$BI have another task for you, and I\'m willing to spare some coin for your trouble if you\'re interested.', 0),
(40471, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Good job! And all of them are of extraordinary quality, too! I didn\'t think that you could do it, to be fair. The last adventurer helping me... let\'s just say, he got harvested, if you know what I mean. It\'s great to finally have someone who knows what they\'re doing.$B$BSo, would you want to help me once more? I need something else to be done, and I cannot leave Sentinel Hill for now. You know, I\'m waiting for a shipment of supplies from Redridge and it could arrive any moment.', 0),
(40472, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Hewen sent you? This son of a trogg couldn\'t even visit me himself? Preposterous! I got his blueprint, but if you knew how much hassle it cost me! If you only knew! Tell Hewen that next time he orders something from me, he pays double!', 0),
(40473, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The Harvester Blueprints...$B$B<Christopher Hewen looks into the blueprints and makes a disgruntled face.>$B$BTo be frank, my hard-working friend, I don\'t understand any of it! But it doesn\'t matter, as I am only the messenger, a humble servant. Those papers are for my employer, who, if you are willing, you will meet soon!$B$BI would deliver them myself, but, believe me or not, those damned supplies have still not arrived! Also, traveling through these beautiful, golden plains became so dangerous lately. I am certain that you can handle it, though. Care to help me for one last time, friend?', 0),
(40474, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Blueprints from Hewen, finally. He couldn\'t be any slower with it. Let me see what is written inside...', 0),
(40475, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Engineering tools. And they are all still intact. Unexpected, but a welcome surprise. Now I have all we need.', 0),
(40476, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'So the person who may manufacture the runes lives close to Darkshire. We need to hurry then; there is no time to waste. Tales of your exploits have probably reached him already.', 0),
(40477, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You found the note attached to one of the crates? But it\'s all written in gibberish? Don\'t worry, we will figure it out.$B$BFor now, we need to handle another problem.', 0),
(40478, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The Deadmines... Interesting. I\'m glad that you made it out alive. With their leader dead, I can focus on rewiring the remaining golems.$B$BThat, and finding the person responsible for all of this.', 0),
(40479, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Great job with these golems, stopping the Defias and whatnot. You and Maltimor did more for these lands than the People\'s Militia has ever done, and no one will know about your exploits…$B$BSuch are the whims of history, pal. But you didn\'t come here for a friendly talk, ay?', 0),
(40480, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'What? Give me that.$B$B<Franklin Hamar looks on the note.>$B$BYes, I can read it. But everything has a price.', 0),
(40481, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Extraordinary. These are good enough.', 0),
(40482, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Extraordinary. Great work. Those needles will serve me well. So thin, so durable. But I\'m getting ahead of myself.$B$BI made a promise. Let me decipher this message.', 0),
(40483, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'So the person who may manufacture the runes lives close to Darkshire. We need to hurry then; there is no time to waste. Tales of your exploits have probably reached him already.', 0),
(40484, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'F.W.? I know of no-one by those initials, but I have a hunch of who it could be, if what you told me is true.', 0),
(40485, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The people of Westfall are safe. Thank you, $N. These lands will heal in time.', 0),
(40529, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I bid you farewell, $N. Thank you for understanding. And once again, thank you for all you did. You truly are a hero.', 0),
(40593, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'What is this, a letter?', 0),
(40594, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Why, hello there. Are you here to inquire about civil architecture in the city of Stormwind?', 0),
(40595, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Why, hello there. Is there anything that I can help you with, $R?', 0),
(40596, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Oh, that is why you are here.$B$BIt\'s been a long time since my Westfall days, but hopefully I can be of help.', 0),
(40597, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'So, do you see what has happened, and who is behind it all now?', 0),
(40598, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'So, you’ve found the priest who led the church. Has he said anything about what happened?', 0),
(40599, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'So, what... you want information? It won\'t come easy.', 0),
(40600, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Well, would you look at that, you survived the trip, most people around here don\'t really want to collect venom from giant spiders.$B$BEither way, you did good by me, so I\'ll do good by you.', 0),
(40601, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The Dead Acre huh, interesting.', 0),
(40602, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You have brought justice to the Eastons, and have removed a dangerous criminal from our lands, for that we cannot be more grateful.$B$BWith these deeds there is hope we may resettle the land once the Defias threat is removed. Let us hope such a future comes soon, $N.$B$BFor your efforts I have prepared some items, they should serve you well.', 0),
(40603, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<Brother Neals reads the letter, his face easing, and an expression of relief washes over him.>$B$BIt feels good to know justice has been met out to that ruffian, for all the misery he has caused.$B$BI am just happy that my information was able to assist and bring justice to that lawless land.$B$B<Brother Neals takes the Westfall Church Key, tucking it into a pocket of his robe carefully.>', 0),
(41390, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Renzik sent you? Good. I could use a bit more manpower.', 0),
(41391, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Jared Voss? I hate that this name rings several bells. If what is in this document is true, then we should make haste immediately.', 0);
INSERT INTO `quest_request_items` (`ID`, `EmoteOnComplete`, `EmoteOnIncomplete`, `CompletionText`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
(40395, 0, 0, 'I am forever restless.', 0),
(40470, 0, 0, 'Have you recovered one?', 0),
(40471, 0, 0, 'Have you collected the runes already?', 0),
(40472, 0, 0, 'What is it? Don\'t you see, $R, that I am kind of busy?', 0),
(40473, 0, 0, 'Ahhh, $N already! You got the paper?', 0),
(40474, 0, 0, 'Who are you? What do you want from me?', 0),
(40475, 0, 0, 'Have you found the equipment?', 0),
(40476, 0, 0, 'The golem needs to remain intact for this to work.', 0),
(40477, 0, 0, 'Have you retrieved the Rune Shipments?', 0),
(40478, 0, 0, 'Have you found the Defias hideout?', 0),
(40479, 0, 0, 'It\'s you, $N! I missed you! How\'s it going?', 0),
(40480, 0, 0, 'I offer only the finest goods.', 0),
(40481, 0, 0, 'Got the silk? I haven\'t got all day.', 0),
(40482, 0, 0, 'Less talking, more doing.', 0),
(40483, 0, 0, 'Finally, it\'s you. Were you able to decipher the note?', 0),
(40484, 0, 0, 'The Night Watch stands firm against the darkness that surrounds us.', 0),
(40485, 0, 0, 'Have you found him?', 0),
(40529, 0, 0, 'What is it, friend? Oh, by the Light...', 0),
(40593, 0, 0, 'Yes?', 0),
(40594, 0, 0, 'Yes?', 0),
(40595, 0, 0, 'Yes?', 0),
(40596, 0, 0, 'Yes?', 0),
(40597, 0, 0, 'Yes?', 0),
(40598, 0, 0, 'Yes?', 0),
(40599, 0, 0, 'Yes?', 0),
(40600, 0, 0, 'Have you got the Venom yet? My contacts won\'t be happy waiting around.', 0),
(40601, 0, 0, 'Yes?', 0),
(40602, 0, 0, 'Has he been brought to justice, $N?', 0),
(40603, 0, 0, 'So, what news comes from Westfall?', 0),
(41391, 0, 0, 'Back so soon? I hope not with empty hands...', 0);
